WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.800
This is the Titan Embed test clip.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The intro runs from 0:04 to 0:14.
Press Skip Intro to jump past it.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000 line:10%
<b>Bold</b>, <i>italic</i> and <u>underlined</u> cues
are drawn by Titan's own caption renderer.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The main part starts here.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Narrator>Voice spans keep the speaker's name.</v>

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Captions move up while the controls are visible.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Switch to Spanish in Audio &amp; Subtitles.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Markup such as <script>alert(1)</script> is shown as text, never run.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Change the size, colour and background in Caption style.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
The credits start at 0:50.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Thanks for testing Titan Embed.
